        production. Every job gets a written scope, a site-specific SWMS and a
        five-year warranty on the coating.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ul class="card-grid">
      {%- for s in services.services -%}
      <li>
        <a class="service-card" href="/services/{{ s.slug }}/">
